  boat_sail) sailboat="a small sturdy wooden open sailing fishing boat with a full rounded bow and a small square transom, the hull painted deep sea blue with one white band along the top plank and a varnished timber gunwale, a single timber mast carrying one plain red-ochre tan canvas gaff sail and a small tan jib at the bow, the sailcloth smooth and plain with only its seams showing, a varnished timber boom and tiller, a coil of rope and two wicker fish baskets in the open timber interior, the painted hull smooth and plain with a clean blank transom"
    prompts=(
